Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:13.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(374,198)}公交站
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排第一的应该是我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe I was in line first
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.30,0:01:18.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我昨晚就在这过夜了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:18.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I spent the night
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就可以抢到最佳位置了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's how you get the best spot around here
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.48,0:01:35.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要跟我最好的朋友碰面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:35.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm meeting my best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.03,0:01:37.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起到手套乐园爽玩一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:37.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for an exciting day at glove world
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.43,0:01:39.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:39.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:40.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(590,256)}手套乐园\N单人票
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.27,0:01:40.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,手套乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.27,0:01:40.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Glove world"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星保证过要排第一位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I promised Patrick we'd be first in line
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.37,0:01:43.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上手套乐园的第一班公交
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:43.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the first bus to glove world
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.85,0:01:46.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:46.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Interesting stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.12,0:01:47.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,介意我插到你前面去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:47.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, do you mind if I cut in front of you?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.39,0:01:50.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可  可我特意在这过夜才
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:50.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,B-B-But I spent the night so that I could
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.10,0:01:53.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:53.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I guess
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.71,0:01:57.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,借过一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:57.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.42,0:01:57.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:57.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Move it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.00,0:02:05.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:05.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.55,0:02:07.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:07.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说好排第一的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You promised firsties
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.19,0:02:11.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:11.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过还能搭上手套乐园的第一班公交
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we'll still be on the first bus to glove world
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.37,0:02:19.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:19.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here we go
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.37,0:02:20.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,手套乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.37,0:02:20.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Glove world
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.89,0:02:21.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:21.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  小兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy, little buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我做个实验
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need your help with an experiment
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.45,0:02:26.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:26.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gosh, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.23,0:02:26.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我很想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:26.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.87,0:02:28.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但那会错过手套乐园的第一班公交
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:28.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I'll miss the first bus to glove world
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可这是紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But this is an emergency
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.25,0:02:35.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:35.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.31,0:02:37.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.31,0:02:37.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.95,0:02:39.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会搭下一班公交的  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.95,0:02:39.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll catch the next bus, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不见不散
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you there
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.31,0:02:52.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,橡子冰沙计划圆满成功
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:52.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Operation acorn smoothie is a success
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,286)}鞋店
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.72,0:02:57.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  你得帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:57.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boyo, you got to help me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.10,0:03:00.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍看上了一双新鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:00.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl's got her heart set on a new pair of shoes
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.65,0:03:02.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的工作是跟她说不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:02.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your job is to tell her "no"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.46,0:03:04.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是蟹老板  今天我放假
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:04.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Mr. Krabs, today is my day off
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.45,0:03:05.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:05.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.91,0:03:13.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1026,550)}裤头村
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.92,0:03:11.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍  那双新鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:11.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl, about those shoes
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.31,0:03:12.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.31,0:03:12.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.68,0:03:13.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:13.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.09,0:03:24.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:24.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:26.43,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(528,426)}公交站
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.01,0:03:26.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,扶奶奶过马路好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:26.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help your granny cross the street?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.43,0:03:27.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:27.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来了  奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming, grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, man
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.35,0:03:40.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚是我玩得最开心的一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:40.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was the best time I've ever had
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.66,0:03:48.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:48.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.95,0:03:51.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不跟我去手套乐园还开心不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:51.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy not going to glove world with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.81,0:03:52.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  我尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:52.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I tried
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.82,0:03:54.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尽了老大的力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:54.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How I tried
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.07,0:03:56.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可大家都找我帮忙  我就
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:56.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But everyone needed my help, and I--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.15,0:03:56.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:56.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.70,0:03:59.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你需要学会说不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:59.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You need to learn to say "no"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.00,0:04:00.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为自己挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:00.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stand up for yourself, man
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.80,0:04:02.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,皮要厚一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:02.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You need thicker skin
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check out mine
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.62,0:04:12.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒让我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:12.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Which reminds me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.27,0:04:16.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能帮我挠背吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:16.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you scratch my back?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.86,0:04:19.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:19.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's true, gare-bear
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.90,0:04:26.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:26.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's true
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.32,0:04:31.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我确实不懂为自己挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:31.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's true that I can't stand up for myself
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我太软弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm too soft
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真希望我皮能厚一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wish I had thicker skin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:41.26,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(732,214)}保洁用品
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.53,0:04:52.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上面写什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:52.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What does this say?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.42,0:04:55.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别丢掉那块又旧又软的海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:55.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Don't throw out that old, too-soft sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.67,0:04:58.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用全新黑心面让它强硬起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:58.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Toughen it up with a new abrasive side"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:58.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1018,532)}工业尺寸\N磨砂黑心面海绵
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.00,0:05:02.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗   是你给我订购的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:02.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say, Gary, did you order this for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好合身啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It fits like a glove
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.40,0:05:07.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:07.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.22,0:05:08.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你总能出手相助
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:08.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're always there for me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.98,0:05:10.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道这怎么用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:10.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wonder how this thing works?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不滚吗  蹭吃蹭喝的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you scram, you little freeloader?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.20,0:05:17.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,底栖生物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:17.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bottom feeder
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.85,0:05:19.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:19.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See ya, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.12,0:05:22.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有一个黑心面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:22.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got an abrasive side
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黑心面  黑心面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Abrasive side, abrasive side
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.35,0:05:25.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有一个黑心面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.35,0:05:25.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got an abrasive side
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我会说不
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:27.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now I can say "no"
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黑心面  黑心面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Abrasive side, abrasive side
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黑心面  黑心面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Abrasive side, abrasive side
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.52,0:05:31.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我会说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:31.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now I can say--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.44,0:05:32.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:32.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以帮忙提一下我买的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could you help me carry my groceries?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己提去  臭鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Carry 'em yourself, fishface
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.45,0:05:41.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:41.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.42,0:05:43.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以帮忙涂防晒霜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:43.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about a little help with this suntan lotion, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.11,0:05:45.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不觉得自己涂得够多了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:45.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you've had enough?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.83,0:05:47.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你缺的可是一碗黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:47.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All you're missing is a bowl of butter
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.18,0:05:49.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:49.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Butter?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.37,0:05:54.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:54.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.65,0:05:56.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:56.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, hello, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.30,0:05:58.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在有黑心面了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:58.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got an abrasive side now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.15,0:05:59.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不错  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:05:59.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, that's nice, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.91,0:06:02.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  可以扶奶奶过马路吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:02.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, would you help your granny cross the street?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.67,0:06:05.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:05.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, granny
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.82,0:06:08.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么不自己走过去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:08.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you walk yourself across the street?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.89,0:06:11.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:11.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day, grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.77,0:06:25.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:25.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.99,0:06:30.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正好赶来帮我测试新发明的消失枪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:27.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right on time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:30.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to help me test out my new disappearator
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.35,0:06:32.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它可以立刻让东西消失
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:32.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It'll make anything disappear instantly
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.45,0:06:33.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:33.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now hold still
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.79,0:06:37.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要让你脑袋短上几寸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:35.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'll just shave a few inches
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:37.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,off'n the top o' your noggin
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.57,0:06:38.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然可以了  珊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:38.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why certainly, San--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.11,0:06:43.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  你这无脑小白鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:43.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No can do, you brainless lab rat
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.72,0:06:46.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还有正事要办  没空当你的实验猴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:46.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got better things to do than be your test monkey
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.35,0:06:47.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无脑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.35,0:06:47.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brainless?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:58.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(234,346)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.51,0:07:01.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:01.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ahoy, there, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.07,0:07:03.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要你今晚加17小时的班
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:03.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need ya to work an extra 17-hour shift tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.05,0:07:05.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然可以了  蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:05.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, mister--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.80,0:07:06.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:06.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.62,0:07:07.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:07.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm busy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.45,0:07:09.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,除非你付我加班费
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:09.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unless you're paying me overtime
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.65,0:07:10.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加班费吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:10.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Overtime?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加班费
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,O-ver-time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:15.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(730,310)}词典
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.76,0:07:17.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加班费
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:17.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Overtime?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.79,0:07:19.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:19.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.10,0:07:21.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,结束  过度抛售
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:21.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Over," "oversold,"
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.52,0:07:22.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超支
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:22.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"overspend"
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.83,0:07:23.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加班费
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:23.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Overtime:
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.77,0:07:25.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每小时付更多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:25.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More money per hour"
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.05,0:07:32.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好肮脏  好恶心的词
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:32.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a filthy, disgusting word
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.12,0:07:35.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:35.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.89,0:07:39.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,估计你要我来玩什么笨游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:39.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose you want me to play some stupid game
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.55,0:07:42.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者跟在我身后一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.55,0:07:42.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or you'll just follow me around all day
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.95,0:07:45.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,甩都甩不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:45.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and never, ever leave
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.56,0:07:52.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恐怕不对  大鼻哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:52.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Afraid not, schnozzward
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.91,0:07:53.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不跟你鬼混
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:53.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't hang out with you
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.89,0:07:55.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就算蟹老板床垫里的钱送我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:55.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for all the money in Krabs' mattress
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.35,0:08:02.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不知道我等这句话等了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:02.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't know how long I've waited to hear those words
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.59,0:08:07.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:07.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正好赶上我们的游戏时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right on time for our playdate
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.63,0:08:11.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我等不及
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:11.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't wait--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要甩掉你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to ditch you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你是我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause you're my best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.65,0:08:17.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就快滚  胖墩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:17.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So beat it, tubby
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不稀罕你来陪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care for your company
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.43,0:08:21.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  准备好要来玩了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:21.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, Patrick, are you ready to have some fun?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.71,0:08:31.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:31.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's weird
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道派大星是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong with Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.68,0:08:38.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:38.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.05,0:08:40.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们叫那个粉红怪物滚了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:40.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We told that pink freak to beat it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.40,0:08:43.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实我们早把你的烂朋友都骂完了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:42.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, we've already insulted
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all of your rotten friends
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没人愿意跟你混
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and nobody will hang around with you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你一个朋友都不剩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause you have no friends left
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,孤单寂寞废物宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Loserbob lonelypants
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.27,0:08:54.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:54.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.70,0:08:55.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:55.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.93,0:08:59.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在  有事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:08:59.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, may I help you?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.86,0:09:03.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮忙把我背上这个黑心面撕掉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:03.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help me get this abrasive side off my back
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会帮我的吧  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll help me, won't you, buddy?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.10,0:09:06.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:06.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.30,0:09:07.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是兄弟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:07.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are we buddies?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你要知道这问题的答案就是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, you know the answer to that question is--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.21,0:09:10.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:10.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.42,0:09:13.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凭什么要跟你这种大废物交朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:13.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to be friends with a big loser like you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.37,0:09:16.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:16.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm so confused
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It happened again
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.40,0:09:26.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为超出正常要求的服务多付钱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:26.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"More money for service above and beyond"
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.07,0:09:28.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.07,0:09:28.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.90,0:09:29.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:29.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.27,0:09:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在又想干嘛了  臭嘴先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.27,0:09:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you want now, Mr. Potty mouth?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.15,0:09:36.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会再讲太出格的话  像是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:36.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I never use immoderate language, like--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.59,0:09:38.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加班费
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:38.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Overtime
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.02,0:09:40.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:40.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.68,0:09:41.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:41.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.15,0:09:42.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我待在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:42.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And stay out
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.91,0:09:46.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等你把臭嘴洗干净才可以回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.91,0:09:44.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't you come back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:46.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,till you've swabbed that poop deck you call a mouth
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.19,0:09:51.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:51.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.69,0:09:52.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:52.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, help me
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗给我订了个黑心面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary ordered me an abrasive side
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.42,0:09:55.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好让我可以更坚定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:55.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so that I could be more assertive--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.87,0:09:57.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花栗鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:57.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, chipmunk
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.16,0:09:59.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可它现在反客为主了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:59.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But now it's taken over
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你别吵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.47,0:10:03.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它就像个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:03.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's like a--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.86,0:10:04.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,像个病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:04.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a virus
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.20,0:10:07.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:07.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.04,0:10:14.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说  你干嘛要做出那种傻事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:13.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said, "what'd you want
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:14.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to go do a dang fool thing like that for?"
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.87,0:10:16.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就是没办法说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.87,0:10:16.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I just couldn't say
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.63,0:10:17.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:17.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.55,0:10:18.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给别人听
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:18.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To anybody
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.59,0:10:21.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以就买了这个黑心面帮我改变性格
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:20.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I got this abrasive side
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:21.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to help change my personality
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.25,0:10:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  别勉强自己变成别人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, don't go tryin' to be someone you're not
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就是你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are who you are
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.75,0:10:29.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你自己就够好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:29.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And who you are is just fine
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就够烂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who he is just stinks
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.30,0:10:33.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:33.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Golly
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得把你身上这只害虫除掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to get this varmint off you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,转身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now turn around
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.36,0:10:38.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓住重物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:38.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And grab somethin' heavy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.42,0:10:40.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:40.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, hold still
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.82,0:10:41.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:41.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.52,0:10:43.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你吓不倒我  小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:43.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me, girly
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.37,0:10:46.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这会疼得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:45.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is gonna sting worse than a jellyfish
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in a bucket of electric eels
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.25,0:10:49.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干什么  尾巴蓬松的疯狂啮齿动物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:49.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you crazy bushy-tailed rodent?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.25,0:10:56.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,撕下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:56.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All done
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.56,0:10:58.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:10:58.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.51,0:10:59.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也谢谢你  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:10:59.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You too, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No problem
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在该除掉这玩意了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think it's high time we get rid of this critter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:09.14,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(680,778)}退回寄件人
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  黑心面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So long, abrasivey
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.63,0:11:16.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:16.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.38,0:11:18.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得跟奶奶道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:18.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got to apologize to grandma
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.12,0:11:24.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:24.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.02,0:11:26.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:26.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.62,0:11:31.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奶奶  今早的事情我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:31.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grandma, I'm sorry about earlier today
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.91,0:11:33.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:33.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So what do you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.46,0:11:34.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以一边讨论原谅的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:34.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can we discuss forgiveness
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.83,0:11:37.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一边来杯你泡的美味热可可吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:37.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,over a cup of your famous hot cocoa?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.74,0:11:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的宝贝  我愿意帮你一下就做好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My sweet, I would love to whip that up for you
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.57,0:11:42.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你得先
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:42.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,right after you
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.74,0:11:44.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己泡热可可去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:44.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Make your own hot cocoa
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.35,0:11:45.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:45.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm busy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.30,0:11:49.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:49.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:53.15,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}耳虫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:55.65,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(245.33,444)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:55.65,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:58.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:58.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(407.575,446)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:58.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(525.742,686)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:12:00.61,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:12:00.61,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:03.51,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(429.192,481.689)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.55,0:12:09.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想停下来也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:09.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying to stop it is futile
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.20,0:12:13.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来听我的穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:13.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So just listen now to my musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.79,0:12:19.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能别老是吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:19.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you stop that incessant babbling?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.21,0:12:25.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:25.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.03,0:12:26.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都已经打烊了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:26.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's closing time
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快出去拖甲板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now get out there and swab the poop deck
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.62,0:12:30.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:30.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, mine capitán
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.76,0:12:42.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一边拖地  一边唱穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:42.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm mopping, and I'm singing about the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.60,0:12:52.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能别唱那破歌了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:52.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you quit it with that tune already?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.05,0:12:52.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:52.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.76,0:12:54.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是太上口了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:54.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just so catchy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.22,0:12:55.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不关我事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:55.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just can it
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.64,0:13:02.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要听点公共电台净化自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:00.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll cleanse myself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:02.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by listening to a little public radio
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.68,0:13:08.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是穿脑魔音  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:08.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's Musical Doodle, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.63,0:13:11.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唱片转啊转啊一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:11.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Round and round, the record spins all day
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.82,0:13:14.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍就带你上天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:14.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen again, it takes you far away
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.96,0:13:17.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想停下来也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:17.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying to stop it is futile
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.61,0:13:21.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来听我的穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.61,0:13:21.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So just listen now to my musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.61,0:13:28.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来你这么爱听流行口水歌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:28.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Figures you would be into that hideous pop fodder
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.07,0:13:30.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是个预兆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:30.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a sign
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,预兆你是个白痴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A sign that you're a true boob?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.95,0:13:33.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:33.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.39,0:13:34.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:34.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.22,0:13:36.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是预兆我跟这首歌注定要在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.22,0:13:36.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That this song and I were meant to be together
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.92,0:13:37.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:37.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.67,0:13:39.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下有两个心头恨了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:39.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I hate two things
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.04,0:13:41.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子们  该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:41.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, boys, time to go
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.17,0:13:48.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  该上路了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:48.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, SpongeBob, time to hit the road
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.09,0:13:49.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:49.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.07,0:13:56.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:56.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.69,0:13:59.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:59.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen again to the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.32,0:14:02.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以上就是声呐乐团的新歌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:02.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that's the new song by The Sonars
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.78,0:14:04.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,名叫穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:04.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,called Musical Doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.59,0:14:07.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:07.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Musical Doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.21,0:14:08.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:08.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.23,0:14:10.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:10.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.80,0:14:17.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这是在开疯人院吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:17.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What am I running here, a nuthouse?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.01,0:14:26.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要再听一遍穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:26.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're gonna listen again to the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.36,0:14:36.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要再听一遍穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:36.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're gonna listen again to the musical doodle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:34.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1036.88,188.058)}唱片店
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:41.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1161.226,869.845)}小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正要找你这只蜗牛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just the snail I'm looking for
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.63,0:14:47.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要听新买的唱片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:47.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Want to hear my new record?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.73,0:14:47.43,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(820.278,668.728)}声呐乐团\N穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道你要听
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew you would
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.90,0:14:56.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唱片转啊转啊一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:56.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Round and round the record spins all day
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.89,0:14:58.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.89,0:14:58.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen again
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.03,0:15:00.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就带你上天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:00.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It takes you far away
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.04,0:15:02.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想停下来也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:02.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying to stop it is futile
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.79,0:15:06.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来听我的穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:06.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So just listen now to my musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.86,0:15:12.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:12.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen again to the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.49,0:15:19.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再放一遍唱片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:19.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's spin that record one more time
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.69,0:15:21.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:21.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's late
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.56,0:15:22.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得睡觉去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:22.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to get to sleep
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.43,0:15:26.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等准备好再来上床睡觉吧  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:26.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come to bed when you're ready, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.72,0:15:44.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:44.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.39,0:15:46.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就再听一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:46.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just listen to it one more time
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,省得老是多想这歌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to get it out of my system
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.56,0:15:50.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唱片转啊转啊一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:50.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Round and round the record spins all day
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.64,0:15:53.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍就带你上天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:53.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen again, it takes you far away
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.74,0:15:56.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想停下来也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:56.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying to stop it is futile
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.49,0:16:00.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来听我的穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:16:00.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So just listen now to my musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.94,0:16:04.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:04.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen again to the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.93,0:16:08.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍就好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:08.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just one more time
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.91,0:16:13.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唱片转啊转啊一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:13.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Round and round the record spins all day
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One more time
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唱片转啊转
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Round and round
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:18.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(446,451.883)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.47,0:16:21.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有点得寸进尺了  是吧小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:21.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pushing your luck a bit, aren't ya, kid?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.55,0:16:23.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你今早差点就要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:23.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were nearly late this morning
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我更认真点工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got to be more conscient-urous
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然我就扣你工资
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or I'll have to start docking your pay
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.10,0:16:28.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:28.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.17,0:16:29.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:29.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what I'll do
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.74,0:16:34.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:34.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.86,0:16:37.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  给我清醒点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:37.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, wake up, boyo
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.04,0:16:39.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是得去做蟹黄堡了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.04,0:16:39.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you need some patties to get started there?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.31,0:16:41.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:41.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, boss
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.01,0:16:46.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,专心做蟹黄堡  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:46.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just focus on making the patties, boyo
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.96,0:17:02.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想控制它难如登天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:02.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Think you control it, but it's way too hard
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.06,0:17:05.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每次它一放就像充满电
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:05.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Every time it plays it's an electric charge
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.11,0:17:07.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:07.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.02,0:17:08.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上一段再放一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:08.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Play that last part back for me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.84,0:17:15.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想控制它难如登天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.84,0:17:15.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Think you control it, but it's way too hard
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.11,0:17:16.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:16.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不该老想着控制
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't try to control it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.09,0:17:21.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该不再抵抗富有感染力的魔音节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:21.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I should stop fighting the doodle's infectious groove
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想停下来也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying to stop it is futile
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.11,0:17:27.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来听我的穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:27.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So just listen now to my musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想控制它难如登天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Think you control it, but it's way too hard
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.84,0:17:34.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:34.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Young man
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.30,0:17:37.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:37.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, young man
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.17,0:17:38.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都说不要洋葱了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:38.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I asked for no onions
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.63,0:17:39.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要再听一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:39.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're gonna listen again
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.49,0:17:40.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:40.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Young man
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.32,0:17:42.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:42.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.19,0:17:45.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在海底的小年轻都什么毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:45.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with the youth of the ocean today?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.85,0:17:48.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每次它一放就像充满电
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:48.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Every time it plays it's an electric charge
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.69,0:17:51.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,魔音会穿透你的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:51.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The sound in your head is brutal
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.60,0:17:55.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在你中了穿脑魔音的邪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:55.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you're infected by the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.81,0:18:01.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要再听一遍穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.81,0:18:01.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're gonna listen again to the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.93,0:18:06.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样根本吃不下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.93,0:18:06.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't eat like this
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.18,0:18:08.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.18,0:18:08.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me neither
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再听一遍穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen again to the musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这推门声一听就知道很不满
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That door squeak sounded decidedly disgruntled
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.58,0:18:17.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:17.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me customers
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.47,0:18:22.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛要跑开呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:22.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you running off?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.22,0:18:24.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我薯条都没到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:24.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I never got my fries
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.32,0:18:25.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我蟹黄堡都没到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:25.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I never got my patty
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.82,0:18:27.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我被洒了汽水
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:27.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got drenched in soda
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.12,0:18:28.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都怪那个黄色白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:28.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and it was all because that yellow idiot
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.82,0:18:30.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老是唱那首讨厌的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:30.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,keeps singing that annoying song
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  不准再唱了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, you got to cut out that singing, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把我利润都赶跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's repelling me profits
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我一直都尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, I've tried and I've tried
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,结果这歌一直盘旋在我脑海里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but it just keeps playing over and over in my mind
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.38,0:18:47.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别唱那破歌了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:47.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop singing that song
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是再惹我这样生气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One more outburst like that out of me
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.43,0:18:51.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就让你回家休息一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:51.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'm sending you home for the day
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.26,0:18:58.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:18:58.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.72,0:19:00.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:00.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep your trap shut
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可那不是我的嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't my trap
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再惹蟹老板生气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One more outburst
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.25,0:19:11.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就会让你回家休息一天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:11.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and Mr. Krabs will send you home for the day
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.18,0:19:12.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:12.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.10,0:19:14.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我感觉越来越想唱了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:14.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I feel it building up inside of me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:33.14,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1161.226,151.855)}魔音
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in blazes are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.88,0:19:38.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:38.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.13,0:19:39.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天的班就上到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:39.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're done for the day
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.65,0:19:42.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想逃出去也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.65,0:19:42.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trying to escape is futile
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.18,0:19:48.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:48.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.45,0:19:53.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.45,0:19:53.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's his deal?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.84,0:19:56.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他迷上了这首拙劣流行歌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:56.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's obsessed with this artless pop tune
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.70,0:19:58.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要尽快帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:58.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to help him but quick
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.30,0:19:59.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可能会有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:19:59.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He could be in great danger
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.56,0:20:02.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想忘的那首歌又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:02.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The song that you ran from is back again
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.78,0:20:05.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道要发疯到啥时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:05.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You wonder if the madness will ever end
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.75,0:20:06.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:06.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.09,0:20:08.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星快来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:08.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Pat
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.14,0:20:08.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:08.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We need your help
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.33,0:20:21.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:21.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.35,0:20:23.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:23.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.12,0:20:25.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿脑魔音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:25.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The musical doodle
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.95,0:20:28.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:28.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, hold still
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会很疼的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This won't hurt a bit
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.08,0:20:30.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:30.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get him
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.15,0:20:38.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如我所料
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:38.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.27,0:20:41.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你患上了耳虫症
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:41.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're suffering from a condition known as earworm
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.12,0:20:44.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一旦大脑一直循环朗朗上口的曲调
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:44.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see, when your brain becomes stuck on a catchy tune
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.03,0:20:46.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就很容易感染耳虫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:46.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're susceptible to earworm infection
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而你的病情特别严重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and you've got a nasty one there
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.75,0:20:50.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直接把那小坏蛋揪出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:50.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's just rip that little sucker out
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.68,0:20:51.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:51.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.44,0:20:52.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能那样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:52.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can't do that
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.43,0:20:53.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可能会伤害他的大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.43,0:20:53.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It might damage his brain
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.65,0:20:55.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要想赶出耳虫  唯一的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:55.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The only way to drive the earworm out
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是再来一首朗朗上口的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is with another catchy tune
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.45,0:20:59.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个我有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:20:59.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got one
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是一首老船歌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's an old sea chantey
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.64,0:21:03.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从前我跟我船友航海都会唱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:03.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,me and me mates used to sing on the high seas
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.32,0:21:07.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海上寒风冷冽  湿气重得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:07.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It be drafty and wet on the mighty high seas
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.59,0:21:09.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,容易滋生泛滥各种疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.59,0:21:09.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the ideal abode for rampant disease
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.20,0:21:10.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟们兄弟们不要哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:10.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, mateys, oh, mateys, don't ever weep
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.80,0:21:12.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是打个喷嚏  就丢我到海里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:12.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I so much as sneeze, cast me into the deep
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.29,0:21:16.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它动都不动
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:16.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He ain't budging
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.60,0:21:19.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝对不会有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:19.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be darned if anybody
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.09,0:21:21.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,戴着西部帽却欣赏不来西部歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:21.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,can resist a western song while wearing a Western hat
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.09,0:21:22.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你给我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:22.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come here, you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.01,0:21:31.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,草原的生活的确非常孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.01,0:21:31.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, life on the prairie is lonesome, indeed
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.01,0:21:34.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大片野草微动  却不见朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:34.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not a friend in sight amongst the rustlin' weeds
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.25,0:21:37.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当我感到孤单  我并不发脾气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:37.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So when I get lonesome I don't have a conniption
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.62,0:21:42.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直接启动装置  生成一个新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.62,0:21:42.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just fire up my friend generator contraption
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好像只让它更生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that only seems to have made him madder
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要有位真正的音乐才子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We need somebody with real musical talent
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.63,0:21:50.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才能除掉它
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.63,0:21:50.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to get rid of this thing
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.27,0:21:51.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:51.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll do it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.65,0:21:55.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,单纯只是你们想要个艺术才子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.65,0:21:53.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but only because you require
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.23,0:21:55.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an artist of such high talent
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.66,0:21:57.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:57.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.45,0:21:59.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会吹那个小玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.45,0:21:59.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You play that little doohickey
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.20,0:22:00.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那叫竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:00.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's called a clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.07,0:22:15.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你成功把那小家伙赶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:15.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You did it, drove the little critter out
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.62,0:22:16.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别动  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:16.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold still, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.38,0:22:21.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.38,0:22:21.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.42,0:22:22.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:22.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.62,0:22:24.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道你谢我了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:24.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you're grateful
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.11,0:22:25.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有多远滚多远
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:25.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now leave me alone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.98,0:22:33.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要我说啊  今天吹的曲子真好听
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.98,0:22:30.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was a neat little tune
